        "sceneImage": "assets/cards/events/scene_karma_k_comp_sacrifice.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "k_comp_trust""type": "KARMA",
        "title": "信任何价",
        "description": "有人传话——说你的道侣在背后出卖了你。证据是一封信，信上确实是ta的笔迹。但你也知道，ta从不写信。",
        "realm": "nascent",
