        "sceneImage":"assets/cards/events/scene_pool_path_choice.png",
        "type": "SPECIAL",
        "title": "清理门户",
        "description": "你的一个同门——也是你的朋友——被发现在偷偷修炼魔功。执事长老下令：'清理门户。'他不看你——他在看你的剑。",
        "realm": "golden",
        "weight": 6,
        "path": null,
        "tags": [
          "interweave",
          "sect_demonic",
          "moral"
